     7	## Mission statement (V's words, condensed)
     8	
     9	Final direction ruling: **GREENFIELD** — a new repository will host V3. The V2 UI
    10	is kept. This mission fires ONLY the REQUIREMENTS ENGINEERING loop, using the
    11	wayfinder method (mattpocock-skills) to dig into what to build, how, and why.
