    50	## 0A. V RULING (2026-08-03) — The governing question: the whole-graph stranger test
    51	
    52	This section is a V-directed policy amendment recorded after the Round-2 handoffs.
    53	It does not alter any seat's verdict; it extends the scope of `R9` and binds the
    54	purpose of the entire preflight design. V designates the following as **the crux
    55	of preflight**: every deterministic structure this document specifies exists so
    56	that this one question can be answered "yes."
    57	
    58	> **"Could the person who asked me this — knowing nothing about how I work —
    59	> read ALL NODES AND THE VERDICT and correctly tell someone else what the answer
    60	> is, how sure I am, what would change my mind, and what they should now do
    61	> differently?"**
