+If CHANGES REQUESTED: what proof would flip your verdict
+
+A revised map/ticket set would flip this lens only if it provides: (1) explicit producers, paths, prerequisites, and completion gates for all four destination artifacts; (2) a wired 05→07/08 canonical 71-row ledger and exactly-once closure check; (3) exactly one owner or explicit V-approved deferral for every upstream human parameter; (4) single-decision grilling tickets or deterministic fanout with durable decision records; (5) ordered, non-conflicting R6–R9 ratification/classification; (6) an exhaustive, dependency-correct UI-output disposition ledger; and (7) explicit rather than prose-only branch/scheduling edges for vector capture and repo bootstrap. A machine-generated trace showing every Q1–Q62, R1–R9, and unresolved policy mapped to one final V decision record and one substantive destination requirement would be sufficient proof of the central coverage repair.

